            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A control method including: receiving first transaction data including a first electronic signature from the a home of a first user (S204); verifying whether the received first electronic signature included in the first transaction data is valid (S205); verifying validity of the received first transaction data (S206); when the first electronic signature and the validity of the first transaction data are verified successfully, executing a first consensus algorithm for the first transaction data (S209); and when the validity of the first transaction data is verified according to the first consensus algorithm, recording a block including the first transaction data in a distributed ledger (S209). The first electronic signature is a group signature assigned to a group to which the first user belongs.</p>
            </abstract>
